# tools/check-licenses compares it with the CGO_ENABLED=0 go list -deps graph of sidecar/cmd/whatsmeow-net
# on each release target (ADR 0007) and fails on any difference; build/ci.sh go runs it.
#
#   <module or std> <file, relative to the module root or GOROOT> <sha256> <licence>
#
# The licence column is a reviewed verdict: an SPDX expression for what the file licenses, a LicenseRef- defined
# in ADR 0016 for text with no SPDX id, or NONE for a file that grants nothing.
